  "prefLabel": "Env-A 4102.12 Anti-static product",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 4102.12 “Anti-static product” means a product that is labeled to eliminate, prevent, or inhibit the accumulation of static electricity. The term does not include any electronic cleaner, floor polish or wax, or floor coating, or any product that is an aerosol coating product or architectural coating.\n\nSource. #10527, eff 2-26-14; ss by #13969, eff 5-21-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a4100.html"
